  "content": {
   "rendered": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Taste and discover Leith and Newhaven</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From coastal cocktails and sea salted caramel cupcakes, to shore seafood platters, take a look at some of the exclusive products, dishes, drinks and experiences only available in Leith and Newhaven.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Plus, save money with a range of exclusive food and drink, shopping and activity offers.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-light-sandstone-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-light-sandstone-background-color has-background\"/>\n\n\n<div data-promotion-grid data-promotion-grid-disable-randomisation=\"\" class=\" alignwide\">\n            \n    \n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl  mb-1 font-heading break-words\">\n    More By The Shore Exclusives\n</h2>\n\n    <hr data-brand-line class=\"w-full p-px mb-4 text-primary bg-primary md:w-1/2\" />\n    \n        <div data-promotion-grid-elements class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n                    <div data-promotion-container class=\"bg-very-light-grey rounded-2xl flex flex-col relative\">\n            <div data-promotion-container-loading class=\"absolute w-full h-full bg-light-grey left-0 top-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden not-prose\">\n                              \n<img decoding=\"async\" \n  class=\"w-full h-60 object-cover\"\n  src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05155836/Cherry-Bay-Cafe-Pierogi-2-400x400.jpg\"\n  srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05155836/Cherry-Bay-Cafe-Pierogi-2-400x400.jpg 400w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05155836/Cherry-Bay-Cafe-Pierogi-2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05155836/Cherry-Bay-Cafe-Pierogi-2.jpg 840w\" \n  sizes=\"300px\"\n  loading=\"lazy\"    style=\"object-position:50.00% 50.00%;\"\n  alt=\"Pierogi available at Cherry Bay Cafe\"\n  />\n            </div>\n    <div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-b-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"not-prose leading-normal\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-bold font-heading text-primary text-xl group-hover:underline\">Cherry Bay Cafe</h3>\n            <h4 class=\"text-secondary\"></h4>\n            <p class=\"mt-1 leading-normal\">\n                Selection of 14 flavours of large handmade Polish pierogi, prepared locally at Cherry Bay Cafe.\r\nEach portion contains 8 large pierogi served with garlic sauce and our house seasoning.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 mt-2 p-0\">\n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/info-circle.svg\" />\n                <div data-more-info-link>\n                    <button class=\"underline font-bold\">More Information</button>\n                </div>\n                <div data-more-info-container class=\"hidden\"><p>Cherry Bay Cafe is a cosy independent café located on Leith Walk. Sspecialising in 14 flavours of<br />\nlarge handmade Polish pierogi, including meat, vegetarian, vegan and sweet options. Signature Cherry &amp; Custard flavour.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open for breakfasts, lunches, homemade cakes and speciality hot drinks.</li>\n<li>Customers can eat in or order for collection.</li>\n<li>Welcoming, family-friendly café, easily accessible by bus and tram.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n            </li>\n                        \n            \n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\"\n                    src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/map_pin_outlined.svg\" />\n                309 Leith Walk, Edinburgh EH6 8SA\n            </li>\n            \n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\"\n                    src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/calendar_days_outlined.svg\" />\n                01 October &#8211; 08 November 2026\n            </li>\n            \n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col w-full items-center flex-1 justify-end\">\n            <div class=\"not-prose w-full\">\n                                    \n\n    \n\n\n    \n    \n<a\n    \n    href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cherrybaycafe?igshid=MzNlNGNkZWQ4Mg%3D%3D\"    target=\"_blank\"            class=\"\n        w-full justify-center\n        bg-primary text-white\n        \n        text-md\n        px-5\n        rounded-xl\n        edi-button\n        py-2\n        inline-flex self-end items-center\n        text-center font-medium\n        transition-shadow\n        disabled:bg-very-light-grey\n        disabled:shadow-none\n        disabled:pointer-events-none\n        focus:outline-none\n        focus:ring-2\n        focus:ring-secondary\n        focus:ring-offset-2\n        hover:cursor-pointer\n        hover:underline\">\n\n    Visit business website\n</a>                            </div>\n            <div class=\"\">\n                <div data-terms-link>\n                    <button class=\"text-sm underline\">Terms &amp; Conditions</button>\n                </div>\n                <div data-terms-container class=\"hidden\"><ul>\n<li>No code or advance booking is required.</li>\n<li>Customers can order the pierogi directly at Cherry Bay Cafe during our regular opening hours, for eat-in or collection.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>                    <div data-promotion-container class=\"bg-very-light-grey rounded-2xl flex flex-col relative\">\n            <div data-promotion-container-loading class=\"absolute w-full h-full bg-light-grey left-0 top-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden not-prose\">\n                              \n<img decoding=\"async\" \n  class=\"w-full h-60 object-cover\"\n  src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier-532x400.jpg\"\n  srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier-532x400.jpg 532w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier-957x720.jpg 957w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier-1435x1080.jpg 1435w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier-1536x1156.jpg 1536w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30123521/Interior-of-old-chain-pier.jpg 2000w\" \n  sizes=\"300px\"\n  loading=\"lazy\"    style=\"object-position:51.85% 53.25%;\"\n  alt=\"Interior of the Old Chain Pier with group dining and food on a table\"\n  />\n            </div>\n    <div class=\"px-4 py-3 rounded-b-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"not-prose leading-normal\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-bold font-heading text-primary text-xl group-hover:underline\">Old Chain Pier</h3>\n            <h4 class=\"text-secondary\"></h4>\n            <p class=\"mt-1 leading-normal\">\n                The pirates of Newhaven have lost their gold! If you find 8 Dubloons during your visit at the Old Chain Pier, you can choose a prize from the treasure chest!\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 mt-2 p-0\">\n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\" src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/info-circle.svg\" />\n                <div data-more-info-link>\n                    <button class=\"underline font-bold\">More Information</button>\n                </div>\n                <div data-more-info-container class=\"hidden\"><p>Old Chain Pier is a gorgeous gastropub, offering elevated pub grub with a focus on seafood. Situated right on the banks of the Forth Estuary, it has some of the best views in Edinburgh.</p>\n</div>\n            </li>\n                        \n            \n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\"\n                    src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/map_pin_outlined.svg\" />\n                 32 Trinity Crescent, Edinburgh, EH5 3ED\n            </li>\n            \n                        <li class=\"w-full flex flex-row items-center gap-1 text-sm m-0 mt-1 p-0\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-5 w-5 m-0\"\n                    src=\"/wp-content/themes/forever-edinburgh/theme/images/icons/calendar_days_outlined.svg\" />\n                01 October &#8211; 08 November 2026\n            </li>\n            \n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col w-full items-center flex-1 justify-end\">\n            <div class=\"not-prose w-full\">\n                                    \n\n    \n\n\n    \n    \n<a\n    \n    href=\"https://www.oldchainpier.com/\"    target=\"_blank\"            class=\"\n        w-full justify-center\n        bg-primary text-white\n        \n        text-md\n        px-5\n        rounded-xl\n        edi-button\n        py-2\n        inline-flex self-end items-center\n        text-center font-medium\n        transition-shadow\n        disabled:bg-very-light-grey\n        disabled:shadow-none\n        disabled:pointer-events-none\n        focus:outline-none\n        focus:ring-2\n        focus:ring-secondary\n        focus:ring-offset-2\n        hover:cursor-pointer\n        hover:underline\">\n\n    Visit business website\n</a>                            </div>\n            <div class=\"invisible\">\n                <div data-terms-link>\n                    <button class=\"text-sm underline\">Terms &amp; Conditions</button>\n                </div>\n                <div data-terms-container class=\"hidden\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>                    <div data-promotion-container class=\"bg-very-light-grey rounded-2xl flex flex-col relative\">\n            <div data-promotion-container-loading class=\"absolute w-full h-full bg-light-grey left-0 top-0\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden not-prose\">\n                              \n<img decoding=\"async\" \n  class=\"w-full h-60 object-cover\"\n  src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30130803/Portal-Leith-633x400.jpeg\"\n  srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30130803/Portal-Leith-633x400.jpeg 633w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30130803/Portal-Leith-1140x720.jpeg 1140w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/30130803/Portal-Leith-1536x971.jpeg 1536w, https://media.edinbur",
